    "text": "World Court Declares Climate Change an ‘Existential Threat’ in Landmark Legal Opinion Backed by 130 Nations\nBy Brett Wattles,\n6 hours agoThe International Court of Justice (ICJ), the United Nations' top legal body, delivered a historic advisory opinion on Wednesday declaring climate change an \"urgent and existential threat,\" marking a watershed moment in the evolution of international environmental law. While the opinion is non-binding, legal experts say it will carry considerable political and legal weight as governments face mounting pressure to meet climate obligations.",
